      <h2>Why Candor exists</h2>
      <p>Candor Digital didn't start with a pitch deck. It started with a simple rule: never claim a result we can't actually show someone. Every idea gets tested on a real brand first, the numbers get watched closely, and only what genuinely moves them becomes part of how we work.</p>
      <p>Too many small businesses have paid an agency and received a glossy monthly PDF that never answers the only question that matters: did this bring in customers? Candor exists to be the opposite of that: smaller, clearer, and honest when something isn't worth your money.</p>
